<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"I'm home!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "500" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供喜び.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Dad<STYLE ID="1">, welcome home!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "Talking_Time.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> came pattering out to meet me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Dad<STYLE ID="1">! I did it with lots of energy! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Um... self... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">self-intro...?"</STYLE><PG>
"Self-introduction? You got to tell your teacher and your friends about <STYLE ID="1">yourself</STYLE>, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供喜びバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> got scooped up into my arms. </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">She</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> sure had gotten heavy.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, self-introduction! Teacher said I had a big loud voice and lots of energy!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"There, there, good job, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Eheheh."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hm? Where's <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Always the one to come greet me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> showed no sign of appearing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There was no sign of dinner being made either.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s reading a letter."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Just because of that?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE>, what's wrong?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In the living room, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> turned toward me with the letter still in her hand.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh, sorry. Welcome home..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">She looked gloomy. Was it not just an ordinary letter?</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">"This came from </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\手紙.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">There was no sender's name on the envelope.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The letter itself had </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s name and address written on it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">Megasawa City, Iizawa Prefecture... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The next prefecture over.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Wasn't she living in the Arata settlement...?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Ryoji-kun<STYLE ID="3">, sorry, but could you and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> eat dinner out?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Is that letter about something that serious?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Sorry, I just... want to think by myself..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"All right..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I was curious about what the letter said too, but for now it was best to do as </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> asked.</STYLE><PG>
"Hey, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>! <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>'s praising you for doing a great self-introduction today too!
{PAUSE ""}
　Let's go to that place today. 
{PAUSE ""}
Um, that restaurant that opened in March..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供喜びバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Zahha!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> answered cheerfully, but the word Zahha―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">an H-row sound after a doubled consonant (the small tsu) is a bit hard for me to pronounce.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Like sutaffu, or Gohho, or byuffe.</STYLE> [TN: Japanese forms of "staff," "Gogh" and "buffet."]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I'm no good with foreign words like these...</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "93" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,アイテム1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "My_life_Without_Your_Love.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\マンション前夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> rode on my shoulders as we headed for Zahha.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"How come </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> can't come?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hmm... <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> has to write a reply to her letter, apparently. 
{PAUSE ""}
So let's go, the three of us, on our next day off!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供喜びバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s writing back to her letter, so good!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It was clear today, with no wind. It made me glad that </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was feeling well.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"The flowers... are blooming..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hm? Yeah..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">With her on my shoulders I couldn't see where </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was looking, but she probably meant the cherry blossoms.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Gross..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That was </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s impression of cherry blossoms.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Plum and peach blossoms look like cherry, but she apparently had no particular dislike of them.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Maybe it was about time we thought about moving away from here.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">By rights, we should have done it before </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> started elementary school, but...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">The truth was, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had asked me to wait just one more year.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Because if we moved away from Motoki-cho, we would completely lose any way of getting in touch with </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> worried about </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s health too, but if she held out a little under a month, she bounced right back.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Even so, staying on in Motoki-cho, with all its cherry trees, might be reaching its limit.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">If that letter meant we could get in touch with </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> again, we might not be here anymore by next year's cherry-blossom season.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Maybe I should put in a transfer request at work soon.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If that didn't work, I'd have to look for another job.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Wow, so many people!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Lots of people were lined up at the newly opened Zahha.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">-aged kids and their parents made up most of the crowd.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Celebrating starting school at Zahha. Every family thinks alike.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, that girl's in my class!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> ran off toward a girl about her age.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">It looked like </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> would do fine at elementary school.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "2000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\店出入り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">―After waiting about 15 minutes, we got a table.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, today we're celebrating you starting school. A parfait, anything, eat whatever you like!
{PAUSE ""}
　Oh, but you have to eat the <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="いた">stir-fried</STYLE> spinach and the salad."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供喜びバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Yaaay!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was happily looking over the menu.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Whether family-restaurant vegetables were good or bad for you, I didn't care.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The habit of eating vegetables is what matters, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had told me once.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Dad<STYLE ID="1">! I want to eat this pretty one!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Let's see."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This was... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">takoyaki...?</STYLE> [TN: takoyaki: fried batter balls with octopus inside]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But strange takoyaki, colored red, yellow, green and black.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供喜びバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Excuse me! Eight of this Russian-roulette takoyaki, please!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Only one winner! We'll order the rest later!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The waitress took </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s order and left.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And what did she mean, winner?</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="2">When I managed to check the takoyaki on the menu...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Let's see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Only one contains an extra-hot spice.</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Thrills and excitement for everyone...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Who'll draw the loser... maybe it's you...?</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">Reading that far, I felt the blood drain from my face all at once.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was actually planning to eat this!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">My brand-new elementary schooler of a </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">daughter</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, eating this!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">What's more, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had even specified the number of losers.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That was proof </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> understood the rules!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> calling the loser the 'winner' made it even scarier...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, did </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> have that kind of </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="とばく">gambler</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s streak!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">No, wait, how did she even understand it when it's written in kanji!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And Zahha, if a kid orders it, stop them!</STYLE><PG>
"N-<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>... Do you know what kind of dish this Russian-roulette takoyaki is?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供喜びバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah! I want to play a game with </STYLE>Dad<STYLE ID="1"> using these!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...! What have you been doing with </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> every day!</STYLE><PG>
